msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫When I "
"learned my father Antonin had passed, I wrote two letters—⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫one to my brother, "
"and one to my mother."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Quando "
"soube que meu pai Antonin havia falecido, escrevi duas cartas—⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫⟪k:18⟫uma para meu "
"irmão e outra para minha mãe."

